			"height":222,
			"id":"904c115ff28afac9",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# All projects\n```dataview\nLIST rows.file.link\nFROM \"Projects\"\nGROUP BY status\n```\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":340,
			"x":-1040,
			"y":-92
		},
		{
			"height":977,
			"id":"6af861bf4aaf4d4b",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# Holding Tank\n## Projects\n```dataview\nTABLE course as \"Course\", deadline as \"Deadline\"\nFROM #school and -\"_templates\"\nWHERE status = \"holding-tank\"\nSORT deadline ASC\n```\n## Tasks\n```tasks\nnot done\n(tags include assignment) OR (tags include report) OR (tags include test) OR (tags include lab)\ntags does not include active\nhide backlink\nhide tags\n```\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":420,
			"x":-660,
			"y":-469
		},
		{
			"height":1326,
			"id":"e2703cd4e32e9b66",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# Done\n## Projects\n```dataview\nTABLE course as \"Course\", deadline as \"Deadline\"\nFROM #school and -\"_templates\"\nWHERE status = \"done\"\nSORT deadline ASC\n```\n## Tasks\n```tasks\ndone\n(tags include assignment) OR (tags include report) OR (tags include test) OR (tags include lab)\ntags does not include active\nshow tree\nhide backlink\nhide tags\n```\n",
			"type":"text",
			"width":420,
			"x":260,
			"y":-643
		},
		{
			"height":422,
			"id":"8c6df6a9ef6a9d69",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"text":"# Active\n## Projects\n```dataview\nTABLE course as \"Course\", deadline as \"Deadline\"\nFROM #school and -\"_templates\"\nWHERE status = \"active\"\nSORT deadline ASC\n```\n## Tasks\n```tasks\nnot done\ntags include active\nhide backlink\nhide tags\n# (tags include assignment) OR (tags include report) OR (tags include test) OR (tags include lab)\n```",
			"type":"text",
			"width":420,
			"x":-200,
			"y":-192
		}
